id: pm-linear-thread-capture
title: Capture selected Linear threads as revisioned evidence notes
description: "Explicit selection only. Acceptance: reimport deduplicates; source edits remain visible; no background discussion harvesting or implicit item creation. Provide typed SDK and CLI, controlled metadata/text disclosure, actionable refusals, compact TOON/JSON, non-git support, README example, public-tracker validation, and npm/Bun CI release gates."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: added,context,linear
created_at: "2026-10-23T16:43:45.503Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-23T16:57:41.080Z"
assignee: codex-agent
claim_principal: codex-agent
author: codex-agent
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T16:44:38.213Z",codex-agent,"Overlap rechecked against current CLI notes/context, pm-review and pm-observer. Core provides notes with lock-scoped ifAbsent; review owns GitHub code-review findings and observer owns explicit agent exports. Linear discussion evidence remains provider-specific. Design: explicit root comment plus direct replies only; preview by default, metadata-only disclosure by default, text requires opt-in, apply requires reviewed revision and an existing target. SDK owns target reads, note appends, history and replay deduplication. No item creation, git subprocess, discovery, watchers or provider mutations. SDK pin remains unchanged; CLI registry is 2026.10.23. Targeted local checks and unchanged npm/Bun CI release gates will verify the result."
  "2026-10-23T16:55:12.185Z",codex-agent,"Targeted regressions passed 32/32. Behavioral revert proof: removing SDK ifAbsent made concurrent replay append twice; suppressing body digests made stale source edits pass review. Both mutations failed the selected regression and were restored. Public-derived validation exposed native note output bounding after accumulated evidence; the capture reader now explicitly requests unbounded SDK notes and certifies total_count, preserving complete replay and revision comparison. Added a large-history regression. No SDK pin or release threshold changed."
  "2026-10-23T16:57:41.080Z",codex-agent,"Public-data validation passed on a read-only non-git copy of the public main tracker at 90a0487: 104 corpus items; 20 selected title-derived Linear-shaped threads; 20 appended notes; 20 replay duplicates; 20 source edits visible; maximum JSON proposal 780 bytes; all 216 source files hash-identical. Source attribution in this transport fixture is synthetic; live Linear discussions were not accessed. The targeted suite is recorded through pm test. Typecheck, test typecheck and docstrings pass; pm-ops lint on the two changed TypeScript files reports zero new findings against seven inherited loader findings. Full npm/Bun gates will run in CI at unchanged thresholds."
